{"id":"4a7ec48377bb048a","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-finite-factor-times-omega.md","title":"有限左因子乘 ω","display":"thm-finite-factor-times-omega — 有限左因子乘 ω","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-finite-factor-times-omega","aliases":["18-thm-finite-factor-times-omega"],"display":"thm-finite-factor-times-omega — 有限左因子乘 ω","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-ordinal-addition]]","[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]","[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"3.3.10 (application)","source_printed_pages":"31–32","source_pdf_pages":"41–42","source_correspondence":"local-proof-from-book-definitions","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","source_statement_status_scope":"inherited pre-revision record; not a new source check","content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-finite-factor-times-omega"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-finite-factor-times-omega</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-factor-times-omega — 有限左因子乘 ω"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" href=\"?note=5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-addition\">18-df-ordinal-addition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" href=\"?note=c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-multiplication\">18-df-ordinal-multiplication</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.3.10 (application)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"31–32"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"41–42"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"local-proof-from-book-definitions"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"source_statement_status_scope","html":"inherited pre-revision record; not a new source check"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,2,\\omega\">\\(0,1,2,\\omega\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a> 的冯诺伊曼序数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+,\\cdot\">\\(+,\\cdot\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" href=\"?note=5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-addition\">18-df-ordinal-addition</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" href=\"?note=c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-multiplication\">18-df-ordinal-multiplication</a> 的运算。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 是极限序数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(1+1)\\cdot\\omega=\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(1+1)\\cdot\\omega=\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由有限归纳，2·n 是通常有限偶数；乘法极限方程给出 2·ω=⋃_{n&lt;ω}2·n。每个有限序数 k 小于某个2·n，故该并恰为ω。这是本地推导的例子，原书 §3.3.10 要求分辨乘法的单调性；“018”是本地ID，不是原书 Theorem 18。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-addition","status":"resolved","id":"5ec4763cfc7da9d5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-addition]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-multiplication","status":"resolved","id":"c6b98d99fde7dfdc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$0,1,2,\\omega$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal]] 的冯诺伊曼序数；$+,\\cdot$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]] 的运算。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-addition","status":"resolved","id":"5ec4763cfc7da9d5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$0,1,2,\\omega$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal]] 的冯诺伊曼序数；$+,\\cdot$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]] 的运算。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-multiplication","status":"resolved","id":"c6b98d99fde7dfdc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$0,1,2,\\omega$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal]] 的冯诺伊曼序数；$+,\\cdot$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]] 的运算。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega$ 是极限序数，见 [[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"0,1,2,\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"+,\\cdot","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(1+1)\\cdot\\omega=\\omega.","display":true}],"bytes":1692,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-finite-factor-times-omega]]"},{"id":"31288cfe398953a3","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","元数据 · canonical_document","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"本文件是 [[18-thm-finite-factor-times-omega]] 的原编号重述入口；所有参数域与该节点相同，下式不引入另一套数学对象或证明关系。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-finite-factor-times-omega]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b","5ec4763cfc7da9d5","c6b98d99fde7dfdc","dbde69396a089d39"]}